{"visibility": "domain", "fields": [{"name": "annee", "description": "Ann\u00e9e", "annotations": {"facet": true, "facetsort": "-alphanum", "disjunctive": true, "sortable": true}, "label": "annee", "type": "text"}, {"name": "ps_niveau", "description": "Niveau d'agr\u00e9gation des prestations sociales", "annotations": {"facet": true, "disjunctive": true, "sortable": true, "facetsort": "alphanum"}, "label": "ps_niveau", "type": "text"}, {"name": "ps_code", "description": "Code de la prestation sociale", "annotations": {"facet": true, "facetsort": "alphanum", "disjunctive": true, "sortable": true}, "label": "ps_code", "type": "text"}, {"name": "ps_lib", "description": "Libell\u00e9 de la prestation sociale", "annotations": {"facet": true, "facetsort": "alphanum", "disjunctive": true, "sortable": true}, "label": "ps_lib", "type": "text"}, {"name": "risque", "description": "Risque social", "annotations": {"facet": true, "disjunctive": true, "sortable": true}, "label": "risque", "type": "text"}, {"name": "regime_nom", "description": "Libell\u00e9 du r\u00e9gime", "annotations": {}, "label": "regime_nom", "type": "text"}, {"name": "si_niveau", "description": "Niveau d'agr\u00e9gation du secteur institutionnel", "annotations": {"facetsort": "-count", "facet": true, "disjunctive": true, "sortable": true}, "label": "si_niveau", "type": "text"}, {"name": "si_code", "description": "Code du secteur institutionnel", "annotations": {"facet": true, "disjunctive": true, "sortable": true}, "label": "si_code", "type": "text"}, {"name": "si_nom", "description": "Nom du secteur institutionnel", "annotations": {"facet": true, "disjunctive": true, "sortable": true}, "label": "si_nom", "type": "text"}, {"name": "val", "description": "Montant de la prestation sociale (en millions d'euros)", "annotations": {"decimals": 0}, "label": "val", "type": "double"}], "dataset_id": "305_les-comptes-de-la-protection-sociale", "dataset_uid": "da_loievm", "has_records": true, "features": ["analyze"], "attachments": [{"id": "comptes_de_la_protection_sociale_ancienne_base_2014_csv", "title": "comptes_de_la_protection_sociale_ancienne_base_2014.csv", "mimetype": "text/csv", "url": "https://data.drees.solidarites-sante.gouv.fr/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/305_les-comptes-de-la-protection-sociale/attachments/comptes_de_la_protection_sociale_ancienne_base_2014_csv"}, {"id": "la_protection_sociale_en_france_de_1959_a_2024xlsx", "title": "La protection sociale en France de 1959 \u00e0 2024.xlsx", "mimetype": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet", "url": "https://data.drees.solidarites-sante.gouv.fr/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/305_les-comptes-de-la-protection-sociale/attachments/la_protection_sociale_en_france_de_1959_a_2024xlsx"}], "alternative_exports": [], "data_visible": true, "metas": {"default": {"title": "Les comptes de la protection sociale", "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style='font-size:11.5pt;font-family:\"Open Sans\";mso-fareast-font-family:\n\"Times New Roman\";color:#333333;mso-fareast-language:FR'>Les Comptes de la\nprotection sociale\u00a0fournissent, chaque ann\u00e9e, une estimation des d\u00e9penses\net des recettes de protection sociale et de leur \u00e9volution, sur un champ\ncouvrant l\u2019ensemble des r\u00e9gimes et des risques de la protection\nsociale\u00a0:\u00a0r\u00e9gimes des administrations de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 sociale\u00a0;\nr\u00e9gimes d\u2019intervention sociale des pouvoirs publics (\u00c9tat et collectivit\u00e9s\nterritoriales)\u00a0; r\u00e9gimes des organismes priv\u00e9s d\u2019assurance\u00a0; r\u00e9gimes\ndes soci\u00e9t\u00e9s non financi\u00e8res (r\u00e9gimes directs d\u2019employeurs et r\u00e9gimes de\nprestations extral\u00e9gales) et r\u00e9gimes d\u2019intervention sociale des institutions\nsans but lucratif au service des m\u00e9nages.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style='font-size:11.5pt;font-family:\"Open Sans\";mso-fareast-font-family:\n\"Times New Roman\";color:#333333;mso-fareast-language:FR'>Ces comptes sont\nutilis\u00e9s pour l\u2019\u00e9laboration des comptes de la protection sociale dans le\nsyst\u00e8me europ\u00e9en de statistiques int\u00e9gr\u00e9es de la protection sociale, supervis\u00e9\npar Eurostat. Ils permettent ainsi d\u2019\u00e9tablir des comparaisons internationales.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style='font-size:11.5pt;font-family:\"Open Sans\";mso-fareast-font-family:\n\"Times New Roman\";color:#333333;mso-fareast-language:FR'>Cette page contient\ndeux fichiers de donn\u00e9es depuis l'ann\u00e9e 1959 :<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style='font-size:11.5pt;font-family:\"Open Sans\";\n     mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-fareast-language:FR'>Le\n     fichier Excel en pi\u00e8ce jointe indique les montants des prestations\n     sociales, des op\u00e9rations et des ressources de la protection sociale.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style='font-size:11.5pt;font-family:\"Open Sans\";\n     mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-fareast-language:FR'>Le jeu\n     de donn\u00e9es ouvertes indique les montants des prestations sociales\n     ventil\u00e9es par r\u00e9gime de protection sociale.\u00a0Ce niveau de diffusion\n     fin permet d\u2019analyser le versement des prestations sociales par les\n     financeurs.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style='font-size:11.5pt;font-family:\"Open Sans\";mso-fareast-font-family:\n\"Times New Roman\";color:#333333;mso-fareast-language:FR'>Ces donn\u00e9es ont\nvocation \u00e0 \u00eatre enrichies chaque ann\u00e9e.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:15.0pt;\nmso-line-height-rule:exactly\"><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57);\"><o:p></o:p></span></strong></span></p>", "theme": ["Syst\u00e8me de protection sociale"], "keyword": ["Protection sociale", "Prestation sociale", "D\u00e9penses de protection sociale", "Financements de protection sociale"], "license": "Licence Ouverte v2.0 (Etalab)", "license_url": "https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/ETALAB-Licence-Ouverte-v2.0.pdf", "language": "fr", "modified": "2025-12-18T05:00:00+00:00", "publisher": "DREES/SEEE/BACS", "references": null, "attributions": null, "update_frequency": null, "bbox": null, "data_processed": "2026-10-23T13:13:35+00:00", "federated": false, "geographic_reference": ["world_fr"], "geographic_reference_auto": true, "geometry_types": null, "metadata_languages": ["fr"], "metadata_processed": "2026-10-27T08:48:26.818000+00:00", "modified_updates_on_data_change": false, "modified_updates_on_metadata_change": false, "parent_domain": "sgsocialgouv", "records_count": 15673, "shared_catalog": null, "source_dataset": null, "source_domain": null, "source_domain_address": null, "source_domain_title": null, "territory": ["France"], "timezone": null}, "custom": {"themes-niveau-2": ["D\u00e9penses de protection sociale et financements"], "themes-niveau-3": null, "version": "Donn\u00e9es provisoires pour la derni\u00e8re ann\u00e9e, donn\u00e9es semi-d\u00e9finitives pour l'avant-derni\u00e8re ann\u00e9e et donn\u00e9es d\u00e9finitives pour les ann\u00e9es ant\u00e9rieures", "date-de-creation": "2024-12-17", "frequence-de-mise-a-jour": "Annuelle (automne)", "periode-de-temps": "1959-2024", "code-source": null, "pieces-jointes": null}}}